  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "1) 求矩阵A的行列式",
      "steps": [
        "展开第一行：$\\det(A) = \\frac{1}{27}[1 \\cdot \\det\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix} - (-2) \\cdot \\det\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & -2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix} + (-2) \\cdot \\det\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & 1\\\\-2 & -2\\end{pmatrix}]$",
        "计算2×2行列式：$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix} = 1 - 4 = -3$，$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & -2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix} = -2 - 4 = -6$，$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & 1\\\\-2 & -2\\end{pmatrix} = 4 + 2 = 6$",
        "代入：$\\det(A) = \\frac{1}{27}[1 \\cdot (-3) + 2 \\cdot (-6) - 2 \\cdot 6] = \\frac{1}{27}[-3 - 12 - 12] = \\frac{-27}{27} = -1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "2) 求行列式 $\\det(xI - A)$",
      "steps": [
        "$xI - A = \\begin{pmatrix}x - \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\frac{2}{3} & x - \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} & x - \\frac{1}{3}\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "注意这个矩阵有特殊对称性。利用向量 $(1,1,1)^T$ 是A的特征向量（对应特征值$-1$），可设 $\\det(xI - A) = (x+1)(x-\\lambda_2)(x-\\lambda_3)$",
        "对于迹的计算：$\\text{tr}(A) = \\frac{1}{3}(1+1+1) = 1$，所以 $\\lambda_1 + \\lambda_2 + \\lambda_3 = 1$，即 $-1 + \\lambda_2 + \\lambda_3 = 1$，故 $\\lambda_2 + \\lambda_3 = 2$",
        "对于 $\\det(A) = -1$，有 $\\lambda_1 \\lambda_2 \\lambda_3 = -1$，即 $(-1) \\lambda_2 \\lambda_3 = -1$，故 $\\lambda_2 \\lambda_3 = 1$",
        "特征方程为：$(x+1)(x^2 - 2x + 1) = (x+1)(x-1)^2 = 0$，即 $\\det(xI-A) = x^3 - x^2 - x + 1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "3) 求矩阵A的固有值",
      "steps": [
        "从特征方程 $(x+1)(x-1)^2 = 0$ 得到：",
        "特征值 $\\lambda_1 = -1$（单根），$\\lambda_2 = \\lambda_3 = 1$（二重根）"
