    {
      "label": "4) 对每个固有值求对应的固有空间的基础",
      "steps": [
        "**对于 $\\lambda_1 = -1$：**",
        "求解 $(A + I)v = 0$，即 $\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}4 & -2 & -2\\\\-2 & 4 & -2\\\\-2 & -2 & 4\\end{pmatrix}v = 0$",
        "第一行：$4v_1 - 2v_2 - 2v_3 = 0 \\Rightarrow 2v_1 = v_2 + v_3$；第二行：$-2v_1 + 4v_2 - 2v_3 = 0$",
        "解得 $v_1 = v_2 = v_3$，基向量为 $\\mathbf{e}_1 = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "**对于 $\\lambda_2 = 1$（二重）：**",
        "求解 $(A - I)v = 0$，即 $\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & -2 & -2\\\\-2 & -2 & -2\\\\-2 & -2 & -2\\end{pmatrix}v = 0$",
        "方程化为：$v_1 + v_2 + v_3 = 0$，解空间为2维",
        "选择基向量：$\\mathbf{e}_2 = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\mathbf{e}_3 = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "验证：$A\\mathbf{e}_2 = \\frac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}1+2\\\\-2-1\\\\-2+2\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix} = \\mathbf{e}_2$；$A\\mathbf{e}_3 = \\frac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}1+2\\\\-2+2\\\\-2-1\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix} = \\mathbf{e}_3$ ✓"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "5) 幺正矩阵的定义与验证",
      "steps": [
        "**定义：** 矩阵 $U$ 是幺正矩阵，当且仅当 $U^* U = UU^* = I$，其中 $U^*$ 是 $U$ 的共轭转置。对于实矩阵，此条件等价于 $U^T U = UU^T = I$（称为正交矩阵）",
        "**验证矩阵A：** 检查 $A^T A$ 是否等于 $I$",
        "$A^T = A$（A是实对称矩阵）",
        "$A^2 = \\frac{1}{9}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -2 & -2\\\\-2 & 1 & -2\\\\-2 & -2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}^2 = \\frac{1}{9}\\begin{pmatrix}1+4+4 & -2-2-4 & -2-2-4\\\\-2-2-4 & 4+1+4 & 4-2-4\\\\-2-2-4 & 4-2-4 & 4+4+1\\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{9}\\begin{pmatrix}9 & -8 & -8\\\\-8 & 9 & -2\\\\-8 & -2 & 9\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "计算更正：$A^2 = \\frac{1}{9}\\begin{pmatrix}9 & -8 & -8\\\\-8 & 9 & -8\\\\-8 & -8 & 9\\end{pmatrix} \\neq I$",
        "**结论：** 矩阵A不是幺正矩阵，因为 $A^T A \\neq I$。这反映了A是一个可对角化但不是正交变换的矩阵"
      ]
