    {
      "label": "7) 矩阵分解 $A = BDB^*$（其中 $B^*$ 是B的共轭转置）",
      "steps": [
        "**构造正交矩阵Q和对角矩阵D：**",
        "对特征向量进行Gram-Schmidt正交化与归一化",
        "对 $\\mathbf{e}_1 = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$：$\\|\\mathbf{e}_1\\| = \\sqrt{3}$，归一化得 $\\mathbf{q}_1 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "对 $\\mathbf{e}_2 = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}$：$\\|\\mathbf{e}_2\\| = \\sqrt{2}$，已正交于$\\mathbf{q}_1$，归一化得 $\\mathbf{q}_2 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "对 $\\mathbf{e}_3 = \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$：$\\|\\mathbf{e}_3\\| = \\sqrt{2}$，已正交于$\\mathbf{q}_1$和$\\mathbf{q}_2$，归一化得 $\\mathbf{q}_3 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "构造矩阵：$B = \\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\\\\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0\\\\\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & 0 & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "对角矩阵：$D = \\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}$",
        "由于B是实正交矩阵，$B^* = B^T = B^{-1}$",
        "验证：$BDB^T = BDB^{-1} = A$ ✓"
      ]
    }
  ],
